# DNS records for the internal laboratory network, served by dnsmasq in the dns1 namespace.
# Addresses must match guest/network-labs/lab-net.sh; a mismatch here is how a DNS
# troubleshooting lesson accidentally becomes unsolvable.
10.20.0.10  student.lab student
10.20.0.21  web1.lab web1
10.20.0.22  web2.lab web2
10.20.0.53  dns1.lab dns1
10.20.0.1   router1.lab router1 gateway.lab
10.20.0.66  attacker.lab attacker
10.30.0.31  db1.lab db1
# Alias used by the web-server module so a virtual-host lesson has a second name for web1.
10.20.0.21  intranet.lab
# server1.lab is the SSH target used by module 12.
10.20.0.21  server1.lab
